hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"976","From us Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Maymun in Alexandria, from us Al-Walid bin Muslim Al-Dimashqi, on the authority of Al-Awza’i, on the authority of Yahya bin Abi Kathir On the authority of Muhammad bin Thawban, Jabir told me, he said: “We were with the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, on a campaign, and he was praying the obligatory prayer on his camel. Facing the east, so when he wanted to pray the obligatory prayer, he descended and faced the Qiblah.” Abu Bakr said: Muhammad is the son of Abdul Rahman bin Thawban, his lineage goes back to his grandfather."
